    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-series compression strategy registry. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Maintains a two-level lookup:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Pinned entries: manually-forced strategies that override selection.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Cached entries: strategy returned by the selector on the last call to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_per_series_compression_registry_1abcd720a2bb1bc25431a96120cb9e5e7b" kindref="member">strategyFor()</ref>; cached values are evicted when <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_per_series_compression_registry_1a4637c74ff19ae01ffd4a47432671a473" kindref="member">clearCache()</ref> is called.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The registry owns an <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_i_compression_selector" kindref="compound">ICompressionSelector</ref> that can be replaced at runtime via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_per_series_compression_registry_1a25d4d923a702fcc581e6fe2f55ddd363" kindref="member">setSelector()</ref>. The default selector is <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_heuristic_compression_selector" kindref="compound">HeuristicCompressionSelector</ref> with default configuration.</para>
<para>Thread safety: NOT thread-safe. External synchronisation is required when called from multiple threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
